    "category": "stale_layout_snapshot_after_dom_update",
    "mechanism_zh": "历史版 Moli 的 DOM 中已有目标链接，但链接及其表格行的布局矩形仍为零面积；同步滚动使相同链接立即获得非零矩形。旧布局快照在动态内容改变后仍被几何读取复用，是与红黑对照及源码相符的故障机制。Playwright 的 :visible 因零矩形无法匹配，第二步点击超时。",
    "mechanism_en": "The target link is present in historical Moli's DOM, but the link and its table row retain zero-area layout rectangles. A synchronous scroll immediately makes the same link nonzero. Reuse of a stale frozen layout snapshot after dynamic content changes is the failure mechanism supported by the red-black control and source. Playwright's :visible cannot match the zero-area link, so action 2 times out.",
    "source_change": "Moli commit adde6e4f marks layout input dirty on DOM/style changes and rejects dirty frozen trees for geometry queries; the fixed candidate contains this commit",
    "build_identity_finding": "The native binary labeled 1.1.6 is a post-tag development build, not the official 1.1.6 release. Both official 1.1.6 macOS and Linux builds return zero-area link geometry; the post-tag and fixed-candidate native builds return nonzero geometry.",
